@Lorrgs.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5247

# Static reference endpoints; no WCL credentials or upstream calls are required.
# Every endpoint requires edition: anniversary, era, retail, mistsofpandaria, classic_sod.
# Aliases: classic -> era, midnight -> retail, mop or mists of pandaria -> mistsofpandaria.
# Validation does not make the static lists edition-specific.
# GetSpecs also accepts optional integer roleId and classId filters.
# Responses: 200, 400 for missing/unsupported edition, 404 for unknown single resources.

### Bosses
GET {{Lorrgs.Api_HostAddress}}/api/worlddata/bosses?edition=anniversary
Accept: application/json

### Roles
GET {{Lorrgs.Api_HostAddress}}/api/worlddata/roles?edition=retail
Accept: application/json

### Classes
GET {{Lorrgs.Api_HostAddress}}/api/worlddata/classes?edition=retail
Accept: application/json

### Specs with optional filters
GET {{Lorrgs.Api_HostAddress}}/api/worlddata/specs?edition=retail&roleId=2&classId=2
Accept: application/json

### Spec
GET {{Lorrgs.Api_HostAddress}}/api/worlddata/specs/frost-mage?edition=retail
Accept: application/json

### Class specs
GET {{Lorrgs.Api_HostAddress}}/api/worlddata/classes/paladin/specs?edition=retail
Accept: application/json

### Role specs
GET {{Lorrgs.Api_HostAddress}}/api/worlddata/roles/healer/specs?edition=retail
Accept: application/json

### Boss
GET {{Lorrgs.Api_HostAddress}}/api/worlddata/bosses/nalorakk?edition=anniversary
Accept: application/json

### Zones
GET {{Lorrgs.Api_HostAddress}}/api/worlddata/zones?edition=retail
Accept: application/json

### Zone
GET {{Lorrgs.Api_HostAddress}}/api/worlddata/zones/nerubar-palace?edition=retail
Accept: application/json

### Zone bosses
GET {{Lorrgs.Api_HostAddress}}/api/worlddata/zones/nerubar-palace/bosses?edition=retail
Accept: application/json

### Spell
GET {{Lorrgs.Api_HostAddress}}/api/worlddata/spells/1?edition=retail
Accept: application/json

### Trinket
GET {{Lorrgs.Api_HostAddress}}/api/worlddata/trinkets/1?edition=retail
Accept: application/json

### Spec spells
GET {{Lorrgs.Api_HostAddress}}/api/worlddata/specs/frost-mage/spells?edition=retail
Accept: application/json

### Boss spells
GET {{Lorrgs.Api_HostAddress}}/api/worlddata/bosses/nalorakk/spells?edition=anniversary
Accept: application/json

### Spells
GET {{Lorrgs.Api_HostAddress}}/api/worlddata/spells?edition=retail
Accept: application/json

### Trinkets
GET {{Lorrgs.Api_HostAddress}}/api/worlddata/trinkets?edition=retail
Accept: application/json

### Seasons
GET {{Lorrgs.Api_HostAddress}}/api/worlddata/seasons?edition=retail
Accept: application/json

### Season
GET {{Lorrgs.Api_HostAddress}}/api/worlddata/seasons/tww-s1?edition=retail
Accept: application/json

### Unknown boss returns 404
GET {{Lorrgs.Api_HostAddress}}/api/worlddata/bosses/missing?edition=retail
Accept: application/json

### Missing edition returns 400
GET {{Lorrgs.Api_HostAddress}}/api/worlddata/bosses
Accept: application/json

### Unsupported edition returns 400
GET {{Lorrgs.Api_HostAddress}}/api/worlddata/specs?edition=unsupported
Accept: application/json
